msgid "Number of event loop iterations."
msgstr ""

#: ../../src/metrics.rst:40
msgid "Number of events that have been processed by the event handler."
msgstr ""

#: ../../src/metrics.rst:44
msgid ""
"Number of events that were waiting to be processed when the event "
"provider was called."
msgstr ""

#: ../../src/metrics.rst:49
msgid "API"
msgstr ""

#: ../../src/metrics.rst:53
msgid ""
"Retrieve the amount of time the event loop has been idle in the kernel's "
"event provider (e.g. ``epoll_wait``). The call is thread safe."
msgstr ""

#: ../../src/metrics.rst:56
msgid ""
"The return value is the accumulated time spent idle in the kernel's event"
" provider starting from when the :c:type:`uv_loop_t` was configured to "
"collect the idle time."
msgstr ""

#: ../../src/metrics.rst:61
msgid ""
"The event loop will not begin accumulating the event provider's idle time"
" until calling :c:type:`uv_loop_configure` with "
":c:type:`UV_METRICS_IDLE_TIME`."
msgstr ""

